#, no-wrap
msgid "How to build a C extension for your Qiskit workflow in Python"
msgstr "Cara membuat ekstensi C untuk alur kerja Qiskit kamu di Python"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Extend Qiskit in Python with C"
msgstr "Memperluas Qiskit di Python dengan C"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore strcmp */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore strcmp */}\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Extend Qiskit in Python with C {#extend-qiskit-in-python-with-c}"
msgstr ""
"Memperluas Qiskit di Python dengan C {#extend-qiskit-in-python-with-c}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Qiskit C API can be used within Python extension modules.\n"
"You can write performance-critical sections of your Qiskit extensions in C to accelerate them, and\n"
"then safely distribute these to your users.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit C API bisa digunakan di dalam modul ekstensi Python.\n"
"Kamu bisa menulis bagian-bagian yang kritis terhadap performa dari ekstensi Qiskit kamu dalam C untuk mempercepatnya, lalu\n"
"mendistribusikannya dengan aman ke pengguna kamu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide walks you through the process of defining a complete extension module, configuring\n"
"its build process, and exposing it to Python users.  The package provides a simple port of\n"
"[`AddSpectatorMeasures` from the Qiskit addons][AddSpectatorMeasures-code] to C.  This is a real custom\n"
"pass with a real use case in the Qiskit addons.\n"
msgstr ""
"Panduan ini memandu kamu melalui proses mendefinisikan modul ekstensi yang lengkap, mengonfigurasi\n"
"proses build-nya, dan mengeksposnya ke pengguna Python. Paket ini menyediakan port sederhana dari\n"
"[`AddSpectatorMeasures` dari Qiskit addons][AddSpectatorMeasures-code] ke C. Ini adalah pass kustom nyata\n"
"dengan kasus penggunaan nyata di Qiskit addons.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Link reference
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[AddSpectatorMeasures-code]: https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-"
"utils/blob/e0582e4aa856dc7b152bacbe0c20d1fa306d9640/qiskit_addon_utils/noise_management/post_selection/transpiler/passes/add_spectator_measures.py#L32-L157"
msgstr ""
"[AddSpectatorMeasures-code]: https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-"
"utils/blob/e0582e4aa856dc7b152bacbe0c20d1fa306d9640/qiskit_addon_utils/noise_management/post_selection/transpiler/passes/add_spectator_measures.py#L32-L157"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"  You might find the following external resources helpful:\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"  Kamu mungkin merasa sumber daya eksternal berikut bermanfaat:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[The CPython documentation on writing extension "
"modules](https://docs.python.org/3/extending/index.html).\n"
msgstr ""
"[Dokumentasi CPython tentang menulis modul "
"ekstensi](https://docs.python.org/3/extending/index.html).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[The NumPy documentation on using its C "
"API](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/user/c-info.how-to-extend.html).\n"
msgstr ""
"[Dokumentasi NumPy tentang penggunaan C API-"
"nya](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/user/c-info.how-to-extend.html).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  The Qiskit C API is exposed for Python extension modules in a very similar manner to the NumPy C\n"
"  API.  If you have previously programmed a NumPy extension, you will find the Qiskit process\n"
"  familiar.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"  Qiskit C API diekspos untuk modul ekstensi Python dengan cara yang sangat mirip dengan NumPy C\n"
"  API. Jika kamu sebelumnya pernah memprogram ekstensi NumPy, kamu akan merasa proses Qiskit ini\n"
"  familier.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"warning\">\n"
"  The Qiskit C API is still experimental. Thus, there is not yet a fully stable programming or\n"
"  binary interface, and there might be breaking changes between minor versions.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"warning\">\n"
"  Qiskit C API masih bersifat eksperimental. Jadi, belum ada antarmuka pemrograman atau\n"
"  biner yang sepenuhnya stabil, dan mungkin ada perubahan yang merusak di antara versi minor.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  For example, an extension module using Qiskit v2.4.0 at build time is guaranteed to work with\n"
"  Qiskit v2.4.1 at runtime, but might break when using Qiskit v2.5.0 at runtime.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"  Sebagai contoh, modul ekstensi yang menggunakan Qiskit v2.4.0 saat build dijamin bekerja dengan\n"
"  Qiskit v2.4.1 saat runtime, tetapi mungkin rusak saat menggunakan Qiskit v2.5.0 saat runtime.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements {#requirements}"
msgstr "Persyaratan {#requirements}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Start from a clean directory.\n"
msgstr "Mulai dari direktori yang bersih.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You must have the standard C compiler toolchain available for your platform.  You must also have a\n"
"version of Python that includes its C API headers (this is standard).\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu harus memiliki toolchain compiler C standar yang tersedia untuk platform kamu. Kamu juga harus memiliki\n"
"versi Python yang menyertakan header C API-nya (ini standar).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You should be familiar with, or prepared to look up, the individual functions and objects available\n"
"in the [Qiskit C API][c-api].  You should have some familiarity with C programming.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu sebaiknya familier dengan, atau siap untuk mencari, masing-masing fungsi dan objek yang tersedia\n"
"di [Qiskit C API][c-api]. Kamu sebaiknya memiliki sedikit kemampuan dalam pemrograman C.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Link reference
#, no-wrap
msgid "[c-api]: /docs/api/qiskit-c"
msgstr "[c-api]: /docs/api/qiskit-c"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Create the directory structure {#create-the-directory-structure}"
msgstr "Membuat struktur direktori {#create-the-directory-structure}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We will use a `src`-based directory structure and a simple `setuptools`-based build system.  These\n"
"instructions should be easy adapt to any build system that can build\n"
"extension modules.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita akan menggunakan struktur direktori berbasis `src` dan sistem build sederhana berbasis `setuptools`. Instruksi\n"
"ini seharusnya mudah diadaptasi ke sistem build apa pun yang bisa membangun\n"
"modul ekstensi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The final structure will look like:\n"
msgstr "Struktur akhirnya akan terlihat seperti:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "In summary:\n"
msgstr "Singkatnya:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`pyproject.toml` defines the standard static metadata about the Python package we are creating,\n"
"including its name, author, and build- and run-time dependencies.\n"
msgstr ""
"`pyproject.toml` mendefinisikan metadata statis standar tentang paket Python yang kita buat,\n"
"termasuk nama, penulis, serta dependensi build- dan run-time-nya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`setup.py` contains the minimal dynamic configuration we need to build our "
"extension module.\n"
msgstr ""
"`setup.py` berisi konfigurasi dinamis minimal yang kita butuhkan untuk "
"membangun modul ekstensi kita.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`src/spectator_measures/__init__.py` defines the user-facing interface and provides some code to\n"
"interface with Qiskit's Python-space components.\n"
msgstr ""
"`src/spectator_measures/__init__.py` mendefinisikan antarmuka yang dihadapkan ke pengguna dan menyediakan kode untuk\n"
"berinteraksi dengan komponen ruang-Python milik Qiskit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`src/spectator_measures/_coremodule.c` defines the C extension module, which will contain all the\n"
"performance-critical code of our package.\n"
msgstr ""
"`src/spectator_measures/_coremodule.c` mendefinisikan modul ekstensi C, yang akan berisi semua\n"
"kode yang kritis terhadap performa dari paket kita.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We will examine each file in detail, building up the package with its "
"extension module.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita akan memeriksa setiap file secara detail, membangun paket beserta modul"
" ekstensinya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Define the package metadata {#define-the-package-metadata}"
msgstr "Mendefinisikan metadata paket {#define-the-package-metadata}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Begin by defining the `pyproject.toml` file. This is standard for a `setuptools`-based\n"
"project, although  `qiskit` is an additional requirement in the `build-system.requires` array,\n"
"in addition to `setuptools`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mulailah dengan mendefinisikan file `pyproject.toml`. Ini standar untuk proyek berbasis `setuptools`,\n"
"meskipun `qiskit` merupakan persyaratan tambahan di dalam array `build-system.requires`,\n"
"selain `setuptools`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**`pyproject.toml`**\n"
msgstr "**`pyproject.toml`**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As of Qiskit v2.4, the C API is not yet stable outside of minor versions (for example, the C API for v2.4.0 will be\n"
"compatible with v2.4.1 but not v2.5.0). In the future, we intend to extend\n"
"this stability to with major versions.  For now, set Qiskit's runtime version in\n"
"`project.dependencies` to match the minor version used at build time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pada Qiskit v2.4, C API belum stabil di luar versi minor (sebagai contoh, C API untuk v2.4.0 akan\n"
"kompatibel dengan v2.4.1 tetapi tidak dengan v2.5.0). Ke depannya, kita berniat memperluas\n"
"stabilitas ini hingga ke versi mayor. Untuk saat ini, atur versi runtime Qiskit di\n"
"`project.dependencies` agar cocok dengan versi minor yang digunakan saat build.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In many pure-Python `setuptools`-based projects, it would be sufficient to have the\n"
"`pyproject.toml` file.  However, our module needs access to the Qiskit C API header files during\n"
"its build process.   Starting with v2.4, these are included in the Qiskit SDK Python distributions.\n"
"To locate the directory containing them, run `qiskit.capi.get_include()`.\n"
"This results in a `setup.py` file that looks like:\n"
msgstr ""
"Di banyak proyek berbasis `setuptools` yang murni Python, cukup memiliki file\n"
"`pyproject.toml` saja. Namun, modul kita membutuhkan akses ke file header Qiskit C API selama\n"
"proses build-nya. Mulai dari v2.4, file-file ini disertakan dalam distribusi Python Qiskit SDK.\n"
"Untuk menemukan direktori yang berisinya, jalankan `qiskit.capi.get_include()`.\n"
"Ini menghasilkan file `setup.py` yang terlihat seperti:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**`setup.py`**\n"
msgstr "**`setup.py`**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Most of the package information is defined in `pyproject.toml`, and `setuptools.setup()` will\n"
"also read that file.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebagian besar informasi paket didefinisikan di `pyproject.toml`, dan `setuptools.setup()` juga\n"
"akan membaca file tersebut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"See the [`setuptools` User Guide](https://setuptools.pypa.io/en/latest/userguide/) for more\n"
"information on configuring `setuptools`-based projects.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Lihat [Panduan Pengguna `setuptools`](https://setuptools.pypa.io/en/latest/userguide/) untuk informasi\n"
"lebih lanjut tentang mengonfigurasi proyek berbasis `setuptools`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Write the Python-space wrapper {#write-the-python-space-wrapper}"
msgstr "Menulis wrapper ruang-Python {#write-the-python-space-wrapper}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It is technically possible to define everything in a Python extension from C.  In practice, it is\n"
"easier to interact with other Python-space code from Python itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"Secara teknis, dimungkinkan untuk mendefinisikan semua hal dalam ekstensi Python dari C. Dalam praktiknya, lebih\n"
"mudah berinteraksi dengan kode ruang-Python lainnya dari Python itu sendiri.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This package defines a custom transpiler pass that derives from the Python-space\n"
"`qiskit.transpiler.TransformationPass` class, but uses a function from the C extension module for\n"
"all of its business logic.  This looks like:\n"
msgstr ""
"Paket ini mendefinisikan pass Transpiler kustom yang diturunkan dari kelas ruang-Python\n"
"`qiskit.transpiler.TransformationPass`, tetapi menggunakan fungsi dari modul ekstensi C untuk\n"
"semua logika bisnisnya. Ini terlihat seperti:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**`src/spectator_measures/__init__.py`**\n"
msgstr "**`src/spectator_measures/__init__.py`**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The exact details of this pass are unimportant for this guide.  If you are interested, you can\n"
"consult the [`AddSpectatorMeasures` API documentation in\n"
"`qiskit-addon-utils`][AddSpectatorMeasures-api].  This guide produces a simple port of that pass,\n"
"without support for control-flow operations.\n"
msgstr ""
"Detail pasti dari pass ini tidak penting untuk panduan ini. Jika kamu tertarik, kamu bisa\n"
"melihat [dokumentasi API `AddSpectatorMeasures` di\n"
"`qiskit-addon-utils`][AddSpectatorMeasures-api]. Panduan ini menghasilkan port sederhana dari pass tersebut,\n"
"tanpa dukungan untuk operasi control-flow.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Link reference
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[AddSpectatorMeasures-api]: https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-"
"utils/stubs/qiskit_addon_utils.noise_management.post_selection.transpiler.passes.AddSpectatorMeasures.html"
msgstr ""
"[AddSpectatorMeasures-api]: https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-"
"utils/stubs/qiskit_addon_utils.noise_management.post_selection.transpiler.passes.AddSpectatorMeasures.html"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Write the C extension module {#write-the-c-extension-module}"
msgstr "Menulis modul ekstensi C {#write-the-c-extension-module}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"  You may find the following resources helpful:\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"  Kamu mungkin merasa sumber daya berikut bermanfaat:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  - [The Qiskit C API reference][c-api].\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"  - [Referensi Qiskit C API][c-api].\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This section is concerned with the actual C extension.  This is the most complex file in the\n"
"project, so we will split it into stages.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bagian ini berkaitan dengan ekstensi C yang sebenarnya. Ini adalah file paling kompleks dalam\n"
"proyek, jadi kita akan membaginya menjadi beberapa tahap.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Configure the header files {#configure-the-header-files}"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi file header {#configure-the-header-files}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When building a Python extension module, you must include `Python.h` before any other file.\n"
"To use the Qiskit C API in an extension module, you must define the macro\n"
"`QISKIT_PYTHON_EXTENSION` before including `qiskit.h`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Saat membangun modul ekstensi Python, kamu harus menyertakan `Python.h` sebelum file lainnya.\n"
"Untuk menggunakan Qiskit C API dalam modul ekstensi, kamu harus mendefinisikan makro\n"
"`QISKIT_PYTHON_EXTENSION` sebelum menyertakan `qiskit.h`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Our includes then look like:\n"
msgstr "Includes kita kemudian terlihat seperti:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**`src/spectator_measures/_coremodule.c`**\n"
msgstr "**`src/spectator_measures/_coremodule.c`**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Write the pure C API code {#write-the-pure-c-api-code}"
msgstr "Menulis kode C API murni {#write-the-pure-c-api-code}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, write all of the business logic as pure Qiskit C API code.  We will expose\n"
"this logic to Python space in the following section.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selanjutnya, tulis semua logika bisnis sebagai kode Qiskit C API murni. Kita akan mengekspos\n"
"logika ini ke ruang-Python di bagian berikut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This section contains only pure Qiskit C API code.  It uses the C API "
"types:\n"
msgstr ""
"Bagian ini hanya berisi kode Qiskit C API murni. Ia menggunakan tipe-tipe C "
"API:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`QkDag *`, corresponding to the Python-space `DAGCircuit`.\n"
msgstr "`QkDag *`, yang berkorespondensi dengan `DAGCircuit` di ruang-Python.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`QkTarget *`, corresponding to the Python-space `Target`.\n"
msgstr "`QkTarget *`, yang berkorespondensi dengan `Target` di ruang-Python.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`QkNeighbors`, a native C API type representing two-qubit coupling "
"constraints.\n"
msgstr ""
"`QkNeighbors`, tipe C API native yang merepresentasikan batasan coupling "
"dua-Qubit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`QkCircuitInstruction`, a native C API type for querying individual "
"instructions.\n"
msgstr ""
"`QkCircuitInstruction`, tipe C API native untuk mengkueri masing-masing "
"instruksi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The first two form part of our interaction with Python space, but when working with them, we\n"
"only need to consider the pure C API.  There is no interaction with the Python\n"
"interpreter in this code.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dua yang pertama merupakan bagian dari interaksi kita dengan ruang-Python, tetapi saat bekerja dengannya, kita\n"
"hanya perlu mempertimbangkan C API murni. Tidak ada interaksi dengan interpreter\n"
"Python dalam kode ini.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that all functions and symbols defined in this section are declared with `static` linkage.\n"
"This is because the Python interpreter will not link against this extension module; we will provide\n"
"the interpreter with details of the available functions in the next section.\n"
msgstr ""
"Perhatikan bahwa semua fungsi dan simbol yang didefinisikan di bagian ini dideklarasikan dengan linkage `static`.\n"
"Ini karena interpreter Python tidak akan melakukan link terhadap modul ekstensi ini; kita akan menyediakan\n"
"detail fungsi-fungsi yang tersedia kepada interpreter di bagian berikutnya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We will not dwell on the algorithmic details of this code; it is instructive to use a meaningful\n"
"transpiler pass for the demonstration, but the precise implementation of the algorithm is not\n"
"important to this guide.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita tidak akan berkutat pada detail algoritmis dari kode ini; berguna menggunakan pass Transpiler\n"
"yang bermakna untuk demonstrasi, tetapi implementasi persis dari algoritmanya tidak\n"
"penting untuk panduan ini.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**`src/spectator_measures/_coremodule.c (appended)`**\n"
msgstr "**`src/spectator_measures/_coremodule.c (appended)`**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Write the Python interaction code {#write-the-python-interaction-code}"
msgstr "Menulis kode interaksi Python {#write-the-python-interaction-code}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"All of the business logic is now defined in pure C.  Next, it needs to be "
"safely exposed to Python.\n"
msgstr ""
"Semua logika bisnis kini didefinisikan dalam C murni. Selanjutnya, ia perlu "
"diekspos dengan aman ke Python.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To begin, define the only function that will be exposed to Python.  This must\n"
"follow a defined signature, which is purely in terms of Python types that look like a\n"
"`fn(self, *args, **kwargs)` method.  We have to return a `PyObject *`, which is the generic form of\n"
"any Python object.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk memulai, definisikan satu-satunya fungsi yang akan diekspos ke Python. Ini harus\n"
"mengikuti signature tertentu, yang murni dalam bentuk tipe-tipe Python yang terlihat seperti\n"
"metode `fn(self, *args, **kwargs)`. Kita harus mengembalikan sebuah `PyObject *`, yang merupakan bentuk generik dari\n"
"objek Python apa pun.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The complete function looks like:\n"
msgstr "Fungsi lengkapnya terlihat seperti:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "In brief, the function:\n"
msgstr "Singkatnya, fungsi ini:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Follows a defined signature to accept arbitrary Python arguments.\n"
msgstr "Mengikuti signature tertentu untuk menerima argumen Python sembarang.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Defines space to store C-native objects parsed out of the Python "
"arguments.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mendefinisikan ruang untuk menyimpan objek C-native yang di-parse dari "
"argumen Python.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Calls a parsing function to extract the C-native objects, configured with the list of expected\n"
"arguments, keyword arguments, and the functions to use to convert them.  If this fails, the\n"
"function propagates the error.\n"
msgstr ""
"Memanggil fungsi parsing untuk mengekstrak objek C-native, dikonfigurasi dengan daftar argumen yang diharapkan,\n"
"keyword argument, dan fungsi yang digunakan untuk mengonversinya. Jika ini gagal,\n"
"fungsi tersebut mempropagasi error.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Delegates to the C-native business logic of the previous section, which "
"mutates the DAG in place.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mendelegasikan ke logika bisnis C-native dari bagian sebelumnya, yang "
"memutasi DAG di tempat.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Returns the Python-space `None` object.\n"
msgstr "Mengembalikan objek `None` di ruang-Python.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The most complex logic is all inside `PyArg_ParseTupleAndKeywords`.  This is well documented in [the\n"
"CPython documentation on parsing arguments](https://docs.python.org/3/c-api/arg.html), which you\n"
"should consult for further information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Logika paling kompleks ada di dalam `PyArg_ParseTupleAndKeywords`. Ini terdokumentasi dengan baik di [dokumentasi\n"
"CPython tentang parsing argumen](https://docs.python.org/3/c-api/arg.html), yang sebaiknya kamu\n"
"lihat untuk informasi lebih lanjut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Qiskit C API provides several functions with names like `qk_*_convert_from_python`, which are\n"
"designed as \"converter\" functions for use with `PyArg_Parse*`functions.  These correspond to the\n"
"`O&` keys in the format string; here, we used `qk_dag_convert_from_python` and\n"
"`qk_target_convert_from_python`.  These functions _borrow_ the C-native object from the Python\n"
"argument they are derived from.  This means that mutations will propagate to Python space, but also that\n"
"you should take care not to release your reference to the Python object that backs them, while using\n"
"the result.  This is standard for Python C API programming.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit C API menyediakan beberapa fungsi dengan nama seperti `qk_*_convert_from_python`, yang\n"
"dirancang sebagai fungsi \"konverter\" untuk digunakan dengan fungsi `PyArg_Parse*`. Fungsi-fungsi ini berkorespondensi dengan\n"
"kunci `O&` di string format; di sini, kita menggunakan `qk_dag_convert_from_python` dan\n"
"`qk_target_convert_from_python`. Fungsi-fungsi ini _meminjam_ objek C-native dari argumen Python\n"
"asalnya. Ini berarti mutasi akan terpropagasi ke ruang-Python, tetapi juga berarti\n"
"kamu harus berhati-hati untuk tidak melepaskan referensi kamu ke objek Python yang menjadi penopangnya, saat menggunakan\n"
"hasilnya. Ini standar untuk pemrograman Python C API.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, we define the information about this module and the function it contains, so we can pass it to\n"
"Python space:\n"
msgstr ""
"Selanjutnya, kita definisikan informasi tentang modul ini dan fungsi yang ada di dalamnya, sehingga kita bisa meneruskannya ke\n"
"ruang-Python:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This method table and module-definition structure are described in more detail in [the CPython\n"
"documentation on module\n"
"initialization](https://docs.python.org/3/extending/extending.html#the-module-s-method-table-and-initialization-function).\n"
msgstr ""
"Tabel metode dan struktur definisi-modul ini dijelaskan lebih detail di [dokumentasi CPython\n"
"tentang inisialisasi\n"
"modul](https://docs.python.org/3/extending/extending.html#the-module-s-method-table-and-initialization-function).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally, tell Python how to initialize the module.  This is the only function in the C\n"
"file that is exported.  Its name _must_ exactly match the pattern\n"
"`PyInit_<mod>`, where `<mod>` is the (unqualified) module name.  In this case, the fully\n"
"qualified module name is `spectator_measures._core`, and the unqualified name is `_core`, so our\n"
"function must be called `PyInit__core`, with the double underscore.\n"
msgstr ""
"Terakhir, beri tahu Python cara menginisialisasi modul. Ini adalah satu-satunya fungsi di file\n"
"C yang diekspor. Namanya _harus_ sama persis dengan pola\n"
"`PyInit_<mod>`, di mana `<mod>` adalah nama modul (tanpa kualifikasi). Dalam kasus ini, nama modul\n"
"yang terkualifikasi penuh adalah `spectator_measures._core`, dan nama tanpa kualifikasinya adalah `_core`, jadi\n"
"fungsi kita harus dinamai `PyInit__core`, dengan garis bawah ganda.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `PyMODINIT_FUNC` and `PyModuleDef_Init` symbols are both standard Python C API programming.  The\n"
"Qiskit-specific component is `qk_import()`.  It is critical that you call this function during the\n"
"initialization function of your module; you will not be able to call any Qiskit C API functions\n"
"until this has been successfully executed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Simbol `PyMODINIT_FUNC` dan `PyModuleDef_Init` keduanya merupakan pemrograman Python C API standar.\n"
"Komponen yang spesifik untuk Qiskit adalah `qk_import()`. Sangat penting kamu memanggil fungsi ini selama\n"
"fungsi inisialisasi modul kamu; kamu tidak akan bisa memanggil fungsi Qiskit C API apa pun\n"
"sampai ini berhasil dijalankan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use the package from Python {#use-the-package-from-python}"
msgstr "Menggunakan paket dari Python {#use-the-package-from-python}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is now a complete package, including a C extension module.  Because only standard\n"
"tooling was used, and no non-standard system libraries are linked during build time,\n"
"the build process is simple.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini sekarang menjadi paket yang lengkap, termasuk modul ekstensi C. Karena hanya tooling standar\n"
"yang digunakan, dan tidak ada library sistem non-standar yang di-link saat build time,\n"
"proses build-nya sederhana.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use any PEP-517-compatible build tool.  As a minimal example, you "
"can run the following command in the repository root to install the "
"package.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu bisa menggunakan alat build apa pun yang kompatibel dengan PEP-517. "
"Sebagai contoh minimal, kamu bisa menjalankan perintah berikut di root "
"repositori untuk menginstal paket.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This compiles the C extension module and\n"
"installs the complete Python package in your environment.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini mengkompilasi modul ekstensi C dan\n"
"menginstal paket Python lengkap di environment kamu.\n"

